  message: "Wiring isbefore WI-fanus: INV-pahoj is the TUI-bypass mechanism that produces exactly the dash/underscore dupes WI-fanus Part 1 lists (analysis-quality vs analysis_quality, ci-infrastructure vs ci_infrastructure, etc.). If WI-fanus runs first, the bypass reaccumulates new dupes and cleanup must be redone. Fix the producer (INV-pahoj) before the cleanup (WI-fanus)."  # 96e5
